  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Engagement and Policy Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen civic engagement in policy dialogue, promote human rights and the rule of law, and support organizations that play a vital role in shaping public discourse in the country. Through targeted support, the initiative will enhance the capacity of civil society actors to participate meaningfully in national debates and influence policy processes.</narrative>
  </description>
